sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor User as Sales / Retailer
    participant UI as Mobile App
    participant API as OrdersController
    participant OrderSvc as OrderService
    participant AllocSvc as RealTimeAllocationService
    participant AllocStore as RealTimeAllocationStore
    participant PricingSvc as AllocationPricingService
    participant DiscountSvc as ShelfLifeDiscountService
    participant DiscountStore as ShelfLifeDiscountStore
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database

    %% ==========================================
    %% 1. SUBMIT ORDER
    %% ==========================================

    User->>+UI: Submit Order

    UI->>+API: Create(orderData)
    API->>+OrderSvc: CreateAsync(orderData)

    Note over OrderSvc,AllocSvc: Order capture validates selected promotions and pricing context

    %% ==========================================
    %% 2. START REAL-TIME ALLOCATION
    %% ==========================================

    OrderSvc->>+AllocSvc: AllocateAsync(salesOrderId)

    %% ==========================================
    %% 3. LOAD ALLOCATION AND PRICING DATA
    %% ==========================================

    Note over AllocSvc,DB: Allocation uses a transaction with stock concurrency protection

    AllocSvc->>+AllocStore: LoadForUpdateAsync(salesOrderId)

    AllocStore->>+DB: SELECT order, lines, batches and inventory
    Note right of DB: Load prices, MLOR, stock and warehouse data

    DB-->>AllocStore: RealTimeAllocationContext
    deactivate DB

    AllocStore-->>AllocSvc: Allocation context
    deactivate AllocStore

    %% ==========================================
    %% 4. SELECT ELIGIBLE BATCHES
    %% ==========================================

    Note over AllocSvc,AllocStore: Validate expiry, MLOR at ETA and available stock

    Note over AllocSvc,AllocStore: Select warehouse and batch portions using allocation scores

    alt Order cannot be fully allocated

        Note right of AllocSvc: No partial stock reservation is retained

        AllocSvc-->>OrderSvc: Allocation shortage result

    else All order lines can be allocated

        %% ==========================================
        %% 5. PREPARE BATCH PRICING
        %% ==========================================

        Note over AllocSvc,PricingSvc: Pricing parts retain the base price after quantity promotion

        AllocSvc->>+PricingSvc: PriceAsync(pricingOrder, selectedParts)

        %% ==========================================
        %% 6. PRICE EACH SELECTED BATCH PORTION
        %% ==========================================

        loop For each selected Batch and Warehouse portion

            Note right of PricingSvc: Use the shared pricing moment

            Note right of PricingSvc: Calculate remaining shelf-life percentage

            %% ==========================================
            %% 7. MATCH SHELF-LIFE DISCOUNT
            %% ==========================================

            PricingSvc->>+DiscountSvc: MatchAsync(productId, categoryId, remainingPercent, pricingAt)

            DiscountSvc->>+DiscountStore: FindEffectiveAtAsync(pricingAt)

            DiscountStore->>+DB: SELECT effective discount table and tiers

            DB-->>DiscountStore: Effective table and tier records
            deactivate DB

            DiscountStore-->>DiscountSvc: ShelfLifeDiscountTableView
            deactivate DiscountStore

            %% ==========================================
            %% 8. RESOLVE DISCOUNT TIER
            %% ==========================================

            Note right of DiscountSvc: Resolve one applicable tier by configured scope precedence

            alt Matching discount tier exists

                DiscountSvc-->>PricingSvc: Matched tier, percentage and table version

            else No matching discount tier

                DiscountSvc-->>PricingSvc: No discount tier

            end

            deactivate DiscountSvc

            %% ==========================================
            %% 9. CALCULATE FINAL BATCH PRICE
            %% ==========================================

            alt Valid percentage discount applies

                Note right of PricingSvc: Final unit price = promotion-adjusted price x (1 - discount rate)

            else No shelf-life discount applies

                Note right of PricingSvc: Retain promotion-adjusted base price

            end

            Note right of PricingSvc: Calculate portion amount and preserve price breakdown

        end

        %% ==========================================
        %% 10. AGGREGATE ORDER PRICE
        %% ==========================================

        Note over PricingSvc,AllocSvc: Sum priced portions for all Batch and Warehouse allocations

        PricingSvc-->>AllocSvc: PricedOrder or pricing validation error
        deactivate PricingSvc

        alt Price validation failed

            Note right of AllocSvc: Do not commit allocation or partial reservation

            AllocSvc-->>OrderSvc: Pricing validation error

        else All priced portions are valid

            %% ==========================================
            %% 11. STAGE PRICED ALLOCATIONS
            %% ==========================================

            loop For each priced Batch portion

                AllocSvc->>+AllocStore: AddAllocation(pricedAllocation)

                AllocStore-->>AllocSvc: Allocation staged
                deactivate AllocStore

                %% ==========================================
                %% 12. STAGE STOCK RESERVATION
                %% ==========================================

                AllocSvc->>+AllocStore: AddReservation(reservation)

                AllocStore-->>AllocSvc: Reservation staged
                deactivate AllocStore

                %% ==========================================
                %% 13. RECORD RESERVATION MOVEMENT
                %% ==========================================

                AllocSvc->>+AllocStore: AddTransaction(reservationTransaction)

                AllocStore-->>AllocSvc: Inventory transaction staged
                deactivate AllocStore

            end

            %% ==========================================
            %% 14. CREATE FINAL QUOTATION
            %% ==========================================

            AllocSvc->>+AllocStore: AddQuote(salesOrderQuote)

            AllocStore-->>AllocSvc: Quotation staged
            deactivate AllocStore

            %% ==========================================
            %% 15. SAVE ATOMIC ALLOCATION
            %% ==========================================

            AllocSvc->>+AllocStore: SaveChangesAsync()

            AllocStore->>+DB: INSERT Allocations, Reservations and SalesOrderQuote

            Note right of DB: UPDATE reserved balances and finalized order pricing

            alt Transaction commits successfully

                DB-->>AllocStore: Allocation and pricing committed

            else Stock version or concurrency conflict

                DB-->>AllocStore: Concurrency exception - transaction rolled back

            end

            deactivate DB

            AllocStore-->>AllocSvc: Save result or concurrency error
            deactivate AllocStore

            %% ==========================================
            %% 16. RETURN ALLOCATION RESULT
            %% ==========================================

            alt Allocation committed

                Note right of AllocSvc: Final quotation is ready for Retailer review

                AllocSvc-->>OrderSvc: Allocation and finalized quotation

            else Allocation commit failed

                Note right of AllocSvc: Revalidate or retry without partial reservation

                AllocSvc-->>OrderSvc: Allocation conflict result

            end

        end

    end

    %% ==========================================
    %% 17. RETURN ORDER RESPONSE
    %% ==========================================

    deactivate AllocSvc

    OrderSvc-->>API: Order result with allocation and pricing status
    deactivate OrderSvc

    API-->>UI: Order creation response
    deactivate API

    UI-->>User: Display order status and finalized quotation if available
    deactivate UI

    %% ==========================================
    %% BUSINESS CONSTRAINTS
    %% ==========================================

    Note over AllocSvc,DB: Price calculation occurs after eligible Batch selection

    Note over PricingSvc,DiscountStore: A single Batch portion receives at most one shelf-life discount tier

    Note over AllocSvc,DB: Physical Stock is not deducted during allocation

    Note over OrderSvc,DB: Published quotations retain their finalized prices